---
// From IINA's website (source/localizable/features.html.slim); see LICENSE-IINA.
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { url } from "../site";
---

<Layout title="Features | Leah - The modern media player for macOS" htmlClass="features">
  <section class="nav">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="nav-container">
        <h2>Features</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="features-container">
        <div class="feature-block half">
          <div class="feature-content">
            <div class="feature-img"><img src={url("/images/shot-scrub.webp")} alt="Sidebar" /></div>
            <h4>Access all you need from the sidebar.</h4>
            <p>All settings and options are available in the sidebar so you can adjust them in an intuitive way.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-block half">
          <div class="feature-content">
            <div class="feature-img"><img src={url("/images/shot-preview.webp")} alt="Control" /></div>
            <h4>Make full use of your mouse and trackpad.</h4>
            <p>Leah allows you to assign actions for mouse scrolling and click events, trackpad gestures or even Force Touch clicks.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-block full">
          <div class="feature-content">
            <h4>Highly customizable user interface.</h4>
            <p>Leah provides 2 themes that match the system and 3 different layouts for the control bar.</p>
            <div class="segment-control toggle-dark">
              <div class="segment active" data-choice="light">Light + Top</div>
              <div class="segment" data-choice="dark">Dark + Floating</div>
            </div>
            <div class="content light">
              <div class="feature-img"><img src={url("/images/shot-play.webp")} alt="Light + Top" /></div>
            </div>
            <div class="content dark">
              <div class="feature-img"><img src={url("/images/shot-watch.webp")} alt="Dark + Floating" /></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-block half">
          <div class="feature-content">
            <div class="feature-img"><img src={url("/images/shot-open.webp")} alt="Touch Bar" /></div>
            <h4>Touch Bar support.</h4>
            <p>Advanced Touch Bar support including a QuickTime-like seek preview.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-block half">
          <div class="feature-content">
            <div class="feature-img"><img src={url("/images/shot-hero.webp")} alt="Picture-in-Picture" /></div>
            <h4>Picture-in-Picture.</h4>
            <p>Leah integrates the native Picture-in-Picture mode of macOS.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-block half">
          <div class="feature-content">
            <div class="feature-img"><img src={url("/images/shot-preview.webp")} alt="Thumbnail preview" /></div>
            <h4>Thumbnail preview.</h4>
            <p>Leah generates thumbnail for the whole timeline. You can preview at any time point just like YouTube.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-block half">
          <div class="feature-content">
            <div class="feature-img"><img src={url("/images/shot-scrub.webp")} alt="Interactive Crop" /></div>
            <h4>Interactive cropping and selection.</h4>
            <p>
              The interactive mode makes it easy to select an arbitrary region on the video. You can crop the selected
              region afterward, or apply a delogo filter to hide watermarks or hard-coded subtitles.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-block full">
          <div class="feature-content mmode">
            <h4>Music mode.</h4>
            <p>
              Though Leah is developed to be a video player, it also features a graceful music mode, allowing you to
              concentrate on music with additional information such as album artworks and artist names around. You can hide
              the album artwork and the playlist panel to obtain a minimal UI, or with all of them expanded to make it a
              fully functional music player.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-block half">
          <div class="feature-content">
            <h4>Superme decoding capability.</h4>
            <p>Powered by mpv, Leah delivers the best decoding performance on macOS.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
